    <h2 class="doc_title">Ferro Alloys Corpn. Ltd. And Ors. Etc. ... vs A.P. State Electricity Board And Ors ... on 15 April, 1993</h2>

<h3 class="doc_citations">Equivalent citations: 1993 AIR 2005, 1993 SCR (3) 199, AIR 1993 SUPREME COURT 2005, 1993 AIR SCW 2025, (1993) 2 APLJ 21, 1993 (4) SCC(SUPP) 136, (1993) 3 SCR 199 (SC), (1993) 3 JT 82 (SC), (1993) 3 SCJ 99</h3>

