</p><p data-structure="CDiscource" id="p_49"><span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Pos" data-docid="1270021" id="span_26">Originally, prior to 1978, <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/1787076/" id="a_78">Section 59</a> required the Board  as
