operation  on loss.  For this purpose, it was  empowered  to
adjust	its charges accordingly from time to time.   <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/1787076/" id="a_79">Section
59</a> was amended by Act 23 of 1978.  After the amendment,	 the
Board after taking credit for any subvention from the  State
