</blockquote><p data-structure="Section" id="p_56"><span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Neg" data-docid="1961694" id="span_30"><a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/1961694/" id="a_81">RuttanjiRamji, (1937) L.R. 65 I.A. 66 and Union of India  v.
