payment	 of dues from consumers.  Besides,the consumers	 can
also  ask for the refund.  <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/1467548/" id="a_132">Sections 49(1)</a> and <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/1687533/" id="a_133">79 (j)</a>  cannot
