jagdamba  <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/223862/" id="a_245">Paper	 Industries  (Pvt.) Ltd.  v.  Haryana  State
Electricity  Board</a>  [1983]  4 SCC 508?	 In  that  case	 the
following two points were raised as seen from paragraph 3 at
page 51 1:</span>
</p><blockquote id="blockquote_122">1.The enhancement made in the security amount towards the
